  "description": "EFM8 USB-HID bootloader flasher (SiLabs AN945): a pure boot-record protocol + record-replay uploader over an HID transport, an in-house Intel HEX -> boot-record generator (with the reset-vector-written-last brick-safety preserved), and an IFirmwareProgrammer / IBootloaderProvider shell for the Periphery.Bootloader platform. Generic across EFM8 parts. ADR-0061 / ADR-0063.",
